== 0, vars, MaxExtraConditions \[RightArrow] All].\n3. StableFrequencies: \
Linearize Layer_1 operator. Compute Eigenvalues[StiffnessMatrix]. Isolate \
\[Lambda] where Re(\[Lambda]) = 0 \[And] Im(\[Lambda]) > 0 (undamped harmonic \
modes).\n4. MathematicalPerfection: Prioritize closed-form analytic (DSolve) \
over numeric. If numeric, enforce Abs[Residual] < 10^-50 via NestWhile \
refinement on R.\n5. FunctionalCompleteness: Map all Homomorphisms (L0 \
\[RightArrow] L1 \[RightArrow] L2). Expose all derived morphisms as callable \
pipelines.\n6. Efficiency: Minimize computational path length. Chain \
compositions via RightComposition (/*) to reduce memory allocation.\n7. \
HighResolution (HARD RULE): All spatial/temporal integrations require \
