[TRANSLATION_MAP (Wolfram Syntax Mapping)]\n- L0 \[RightArrow] MetricSpace[0] \
& TopologyData[Sphere].\n- L1 \[RightArrow] VariationalD[Action, \
\[CapitalPsi][x, \[Mu]], {x, \[Mu]}] generating PDEs.\n- L2 \[RightArrow] \
