Cell["5. Constant-Background Existence Test", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0607765e-b301-6844-9f42-744d2da84c95"],

Cell["\<\
This directly tests the claim that a nonzero constant observer source \
necessarily forbids a constant vacuum. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e4761867-13bd-1b49-bf78-7d5a7c5f89d2"],

