  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"a92b5c1e-af03-c849-a312-239740f2a27a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["14. Suggested Next Real Extensions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1d8cc200-bdbd-2047-9f91-ca3d11336eb5"],

Cell["\<\
To make this even more physically complete, the next non-mock extensions \
would be: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b1ef4f0d-f0e4-ee48-8f92-cb233762443c"],

Cell["promote the reduced 1D model to a true 2D or 3D FEM PDE,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"48378e65-13d6-c748-bfa6-54f35267f1d4"],

Cell["\<\
define the Layer 0 sphere topology explicitly with a mesh/manifold \
representation,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6d652d38-7e8e-9443-a749-53ec3ccf6c49"],

Cell["\<\
derive a genuine OPF tensor field action instead of the scalar reduced action,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"56f72101-0142-3047-ab99-10fc26859784"],

Cell["\<\
compute full modal projections over a finite element eigenbasis,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"c3940bbf-2c18-b443-998b-c5446d278ab5"],

Cell["\<\
add manufactured-solution verification and mesh convergence tests,\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"f3265d90-bd1e-ba44-9fba-ed08e83cd8d5"],

Cell["add parameter inference for unresolved OPF constants.", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"87826f6f-960b-3540-be1e-43d4fd3e4479"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Useful testing infrastructure in the Wolfram stack includes ",
 ButtonBox["VerificationTest",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/VerificationTest"],
 ", ",
 ButtonBox["TestReport",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->"paclet:ref/TestReport"],
 ", and the PDE verification notebooks such as ",
 ButtonBox["Solid Mechanics Model Verification Tests",
  BaseStyle->"Link",
  ButtonData->
   "paclet:PDEModels/tutorial/StructuralMechanics/\
SolidMechanicsVerificationTests"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"53d51531-4878-5e4e-b693-1bc88d680181"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
